From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:26:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the libktx sources (Source/KTX)

The directory is no longer referenced by the build since the switch to
Ktx2Reader. Removing it takes the Apache-2.0 KTX-Software code out of
the tree. Tools/GenerateBlueNoiseKTX2.cpp, a standalone tool that is not
built by CMake, still uses the libktx API and would need KTX-Software
installed separately.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
